{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_002chi0453_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_002chi0453_1000_p", "source_sha256": "67c58778b4acfd38665d286834b293ce3044664765599357f1e7f7bc3fdbd093", "ja": "（もうすぐ『ルナ』の天体公演が始まる。アイドル達も\n最後の追い込みに力をいれているようだけど……）", "zh": "（《Luna》的天体公演马上就要开始了。偶像们似乎也在为最后冲刺全力以赴，不过……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_002chi0453_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_002chi0453_1001_002chi", "source_sha256": "3cbaaa2463ed354008888c6689301952789273c0947c08372441e7f8ef565aba", "ja": "確か……ここで手を大きく見せて、\n後に続く振りを……。", "zh": "对了……在这里把手的动作做大一些，\n然后接下来的动作是……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_002chi0453_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_002chi0453_1002_p", "source_sha256": "985785d7d8772da3ccc3038b8c005a0392d5aa26484d8183abedb31f80cd2408", "ja": "千早、まだ残ってたのか……ん？", "zh": "千早，你还没走啊……嗯？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_002chi0453_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_002chi0453_1003_002chi", "source_sha256": "562a9f2fdc8aa86e285032be68195f7fd954c65ce572622e21e913c1f089235d", "ja": "あ、{$P$}。\nお疲れ様です。", "zh": "啊，{$P$}先生。\n辛苦了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_002chi0453_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_002chi0453_1004_p", "source_sha256": "32241a0fb03039b11b02a4baae94025b5c819fa526853572276fc97a31cdc0ba", "ja": "お疲れ様。\n今の振り付けは、もしかして……。", "zh": "辛苦了。\n刚才的舞蹈动作，难道是……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_002chi0453_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_002chi0453_1005_002chi", "source_sha256": "8993d5c022a66ceb86dd7a77e63b58f0afdd4654250303d7bf3e7305d223bb46", "ja": "はい、『ソル』の『SunRiser』です。\nステージ映像を見て、覚えました。", "zh": "是的，是『Sol』的《SunRiser》。\n我看了舞台影像，把它记住了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_002chi0453_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_002chi0453_1006_002chi", "source_sha256": "5912bc5ee4b7a27c6b6c1f355626b0f74d924575365d320c93d480182be6e3af", "ja": "……はっ。\nもしかして、いけませんでしたか？", "zh": "……啊。\n难道，我不该这样吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_002chi0453_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_002chi0453_1007_p", "source_sha256": "96a160d474daeb82b7d1bbfa08849d89893eb471f5f03519cc4a12c5a0fe617b", "ja": "いや、それは全然いいんだけど。\nでも、どうして？　千早は『ルナ』なのに。", "zh": "不，那样完全没问题。\n不过，为什么呢？千早明明是“露娜”。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_002chi0453_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_002chi0453_1008_002chi", "source_sha256": "2725fb1b75b93a4e69ba66aca00b49e02ad6dc0c54d08da6faf3592175769bba", "ja": "月は太陽と表裏一体、対照的なものですから。\n何か通じるものがあるかと思って。", "zh": "月亮与太阳相辅相成，是对照的存在。\n我想着或许能从中找到一些共通之处。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_002chi0453_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_002chi0453_1009_p", "source_sha256": "e0d1d18b471140e72341bf7d9bc6ad68e21fa5ea79be6aa89b697418dd160835", "ja": "なるほど、『ルナ』のダンスの参考にってことか。\nすっかりダンスにもどん欲になったな。", "zh": "原来是想参考“Luna”的舞蹈啊。\n你已经完全变得对舞蹈充满渴望了呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_002chi0453_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_002chi0453_1010_p", "source_sha256": "15a2b1cfe476c3695aee5f8999d57df6d5d8f3b653d8d7e0d5a0f2f8ae5c9722", "ja": "それで、何かつかめたのか？", "zh": "那么，有什么收获吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_002chi0453_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_002chi0453_1011_002chi", "source_sha256": "f3741ea0b48b08aa6496c3df8a9f588ba056e7e6872387d89bcf0964eedaf33e", "ja": "まだ、これからです。\nただ……ひとつだけ、すぐにわかったことが。", "zh": "还没，接下来才要开始。\n不过……唯有一件事，我马上就明白了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_002chi0453_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_002chi0453_1012_002chi", "source_sha256": "13d4240337ed223502d182cca8ff53cb182745495da937a92bd2e8ed5b3aef75", "ja": "月と太陽の違いが、振り付けの違いになっていること。\n振り付けの脈絡、意図を感じ取れました。", "zh": "月亮与太阳的差异，体现在了编舞的差异上。\n我能感受到编舞的脉络与意图。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_002chi0453_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_002chi0453_1013_002chi", "source_sha256": "5c1eca64ee50f2a81e6257010405ec6ca4802367ef3854a11a97740698b02435", "ja": "動作のひとつひとつだけではなく、\n構成にも意味があって、流れるような必然がある……。", "zh": "不仅每一个动作，\n连编排也蕴含着意义，有着如行云流水般的必然……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_002chi0453_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_002chi0453_1014_002chi", "source_sha256": "c2c51a593caf140707d4bbdc4b601f16e2062d3217198d9b7eee011f4692b3ec", "ja": "振り付けもひもとけば、\n音符が美しく並ぶ楽譜のようなものですね。", "zh": "如果仔细解读舞蹈动作，\n也会发现它就像音符优美排列的乐谱一样呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_002chi0453_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_002chi0453_1015_p", "source_sha256": "5e59c34b4f797ad49280681c5e243e4b68479786076f07a66a385c663ef2c62e", "ja": "……そうかもしれないな。\nまして、振り付けと歌は二つで一つだから。", "zh": "……或许是这样吧。更何况，舞蹈和歌声本就是一体两面。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_002chi0453_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_002chi0453_1016_002chi", "source_sha256": "434c16e43f4b71aa861ee7a06f10027c20b27b6f0e9cf9d78ce5e3d41550750a", "ja": "はい。お互いを高め合い、補い合って……。\nそういえば、月と太陽の関係に似ています。", "zh": "是的。彼此促进、相互弥补……  \n这么说来，和月亮与太阳的关系很相似。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_002chi0453_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_002chi0453_1017_002chi", "source_sha256": "e06649b9393da138920a14b0083c319292ff46c13e3847a7f095ca03333eba29", "ja": "どちらか一つだけを見つめて手を伸ばすのは、\nそもそも、間違いだったのかもしれません。", "zh": "或许，从一开始，只注视着其中一方并伸出手，就是错的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_002chi0453_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_002chi0453_1018_p", "source_sha256": "8934a5f56d16914c79584ca2bb6f40caa373ac2816c46af198c7216ede50daf5", "ja": "おお、いろんな気付きに繋がってるみたいだな……。\nよし、他のメンバーにも覚えてもらうか！", "zh": "哦，看来这似乎让我们有了许多新的发现……  \n好，那也让其他成员记住吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_002chi0453_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_002chi0453_1019_002chi", "source_sha256": "c6e529b74c3b58a6a3a91705bdcce53162b346e2683c15c1787ab4bc043fcea1", "ja": "いいと思います。ぜひ勧めてください。\nよろしければ、{$P$}もぜひ。", "zh": "我觉得很好。请务必推荐给她们。\n如果可以的话，也请让{$P$}试试。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_002chi0453_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_002chi0453_1020_p", "source_sha256": "f2bacfe618206e56d51d80936925d4d5f6467fb858c9e01363c24c30bfe329f8", "ja": "え？　俺も『ソル』と『ルナ』の振り付けを？", "zh": "诶？我也要跳《Sol》和《Luna》的舞吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_002chi0453_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_002chi0453_1021_002chi", "source_sha256": "1354ff004f94b8adea6f24bf13d3421494d70ceb030af0437e502218f56bd3d6", "ja": "はい。もうひとつ、気づいたので。\n月と太陽の関係に似ているものに。", "zh": "是的。我还注意到了一件事。  \n有一种关系，和月亮与太阳很相似。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_002chi0453_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_002chi0453_1022_002chi", "source_sha256": "f707fc2fdefe7a901ff5d4ffb6f5b3c6d0def15e8d9117a7d51cbb6ddd2360a4", "ja": "アイドルと、プロデューサーです。\n……ふふっ。", "zh": "是偶像与制作人。\n……呵呵。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
